WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.620
Dana asked for a hand planning her fall

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:05.320
course, and got a wall of suggestions.

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:07.460
Good ideas, sure.

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:10.500
Just more than anyone can digest on a screen.

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:12.980
When she hit the parts that really needed

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:15.620
human judgment, the AI offered a printable

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:16.860
worksheet instead.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.340
Then it did something pretty unusual for

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:21.160
software:

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:23.900
it stopped talking.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:29.080
The worksheet puts the AI's suggestions

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:30.840
on one side to react against,

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:33.380
and leaves the decisions wide open.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:35.840
Because once you see an example,

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:37.440
it steers your thinking.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.860
Blank space lets your own instincts take

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:40.500
over.

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:44.840
Out on the porch with hot coffee,

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:47.140
no timers, and room to think.

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:52.000
A confident AI suggestion gets crossed

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.420
out with a quick note.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:56.540
Stepping away from the screen can feel

00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:57.820
like slowing down.

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:00.760
That's usually where the real clarity happens.

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:09.340
Next morning, a couple quick photos go

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:10.520
back into the chat.

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:15.000
The AI reads her handwriting and picks

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:16.260
up where she left off.

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:18.400
Her ink gets the final say.

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:21.940
Paper Session comes in two parts:

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:23.340
one makes the worksheet,

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:24.400
one reads it back.

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:26.460
Grab both at paper-session.com,

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:29.340
print a page, and go think.
